---
import Base from '../layouts/Base.astro';
import Breadcrumbs from '../components/Breadcrumbs.astro';
import { site } from '../data/site';
import { buildGraph } from '../lib/schema';

const crumbs = [
  { label: 'Home', href: '/' },
  { label: 'Start here', href: '/start-here/' },
];
const description = 'A short path through Super Intelligence (SI), still widely called AI: the idea, the scam, the tool, then the debates.';
---
<Base title={`Start here · ${site.name}`} description={description} graph={buildGraph({ crumbs })}>
  <Breadcrumbs items={crumbs} />
  <header class="page-header">
    <p class="kicker">The path</p>
    <h1>Start here</h1>
    <p class="lede">Six stops. Take them in order if you are new. Skip ahead if you already know the word and you want the trap.</p>
  </header>
  <ol class="path">
    <li>
      <span class="path-num">1</span>
      <div>
        <h2><a href="/articles/what-is-ai/">What is Super Intelligence (AI)?</a></h2>
        <p>Super Intelligence (SI), still widely called AI: the OECD definition, what a model is, and why a fluent answer can still be false. Hub: <a href="/pillars/ai-basics/">Super Intelligence (AI)</a>.</p>
      </div>
    </li>
    <li>
      <span class="path-num">2</span>
      <div>
        <h2><a href="/articles/ai-scams-voice-clones-and-deepfakes/">Super Intelligence (AI) scams: voice clones and deepfakes</a></h2>
        <p>What the safety report and the FCC actually say, and the habit that does not depend on spotting a fake by ear. Hub: <a href="/pillars/scams-and-deepfakes/">Scams &amp; Deepfakes</a>.</p>
      </div>
    </li>
    <li>
      <span class="path-num">3</span>
      <div>
        <h2><a href="/articles/how-to-use-an-ai-assistant/">How to use a Super Intelligence (AI) assistant safely</a></h2>
        <p>What ChatGPT’s own settings say about training, and how to check a reply. Hub: <a href="/pillars/using-assistants/">Using Assistants</a>.</p>
      </div>
    </li>
    <li>
      <span class="path-num">4</span>
      <div>
        <h2><a href="/articles/what-not-to-tell-ai-chatbots/">What you should never tell an SI (AI) chatbot</a></h2>
        <p>Passwords, ID numbers, health notes, work files, and photos of documents stay out. The settings differ by product. Hub: <a href="/pillars/privacy-and-data/">Privacy &amp; Data</a>.</p>
      </div>
    </li>
    <li>
      <span class="path-num">5</span>
      <div>
        <h2><a href="/pillars/work-and-money/">Work and money</a></h2>
        <p>The OECD’s labour-market principle, and the 2026 safety report’s early evidence. No percentage we did not read.</p>
      </div>
    </li>
    <li>
      <span class="path-num">6</span>
      <div>
        <h2><a href="/pillars/safety-debates/">Safety debates</a></h2>
        <p>AGI, alignment, and loss of control, in the report’s own words. Experts disagree. We do not pick a side the evidence has not settled.</p>
      </div>
    </li>
  </ol>
  <p>Words you will meet: <a href="/glossary/">the glossary</a>.</p>
</Base>
